{
  "$comment": "DRAFT Nigerian Pidgin red-flag rules (FR-05, PRD 9.1 layer 1). NOT CLINICALLY APPROVED and NOT YET REVIEWED BY A NATIVE SPEAKER: seed list for the local demo only. English rules (en.json) always run as well, because Pidgin speakers often code-switch, so this file only adds Pidgin-specific wording. Matching rules are the same as en.json (normalised text, whole words; see en.json $comment).",
  "language": "pcm",
